stsh:NamedParameterFunctionCallShape sh:sparql _:e8968c1019fa933f71047c2fea07c563 .
_:e8968c1019fa933f71047c2fea07c563 sh:select "\n\t\t\tSELECT $this\n\t\t\tWHERE {\n\t\t\t\tFILTER NOT EXISTS {\n\t\t\t\t\t$this ?p ?o .\n\t\t\t\t\tFILTER (?p != <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message>)\n\t\t\t\t\t?param <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> ?p .\n\t\t\t\t\t?param <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#keyParameter> true .\n\t\t\t\t\t?fn <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#parameter> ?param .\n\t\t\t\t\t?fn a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NamedParameterExpressionFunction> .\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t" ;
	sh:message "Value does not look like a call to any declared sh:NamedParameterExpressionFunction (no predicate matches a declared key parameter's sh:path)."@en .
stsh:NamedParameterFunctionCallShape rdfs:comment "Matches SHACL 1.2 Node Expressions' Custom Named Parameter Expression call convention: some predicate other than sh:message that is the sh:path of a sh:keyParameter true parameter of some declared sh:NamedParameterExpressionFunction. Structural only - does not confirm sh:bodyExpression is itself well-formed."@en ;
	rdfs:label "Structurally shaped like a call to a custom Named Parameter Expression Function"@en ;
	a sh:NodeShape .
stsh:NodeExpressionFunctionCallShape sh:sparql _:a5b90823cdee8375434fe2b68abb5f9 .
_:a5b90823cdee8375434fe2b68abb5f9 sh:select "\n\t\t\tSELECT $this\n\t\t\tWHERE {\n\t\t\t\tFILTER NOT EXISTS {\n\t\t\t\t\t$this ?p ?o .\n\t\t\t\t\tFILTER (?p != <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message>)\n\t\t\t\t\t?o <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> ?f .\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t" ;
	sh:message "Value does not look like a SHACL Function call (no predicate other than sh:message has a list-shaped object)."@en .
stsh:NodeExpressionFunctionCallShape rdfs:comment "Matches pyshacl's own FunctionExpression detection: some predicate other than sh:message whose object is a well-formed list (has rdf:first). Structural only - does not confirm the referenced function is actually defined via sh:SPARQLFunction/sh:JSFunction, or that the argument count/types match."@en ;
	rdfs:label "Structurally shaped like a SHACL Function call"@en ;
